{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54263","headline":"题九疑山 · 刘松","name":"题九疑山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵山登暂歇，欲别忍携筇。\n却上云房後，翻思尘世慵。\n坛铺秋月静，竹挂晓烟浓。\n稽首壶中客，仙方愿指踪。\n（见同治十一年刊锡荣纂《萍乡县志》卷六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}